WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.234
A tiny San

00:00:01.046 --> 00:00:02.295
Francisco that moves

00:00:02.107 --> 00:00:03.050
in real time

00:00:03.582 --> 00:00:04.820
Small SF is

00:00:04.632 --> 00:00:05.598
an illustrated

00:00:05.728 --> 00:00:07.013
isometric map of

00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:08.074
San Francisco you

00:00:07.886 --> 00:00:08.865
can drag and

00:00:08.676 --> 00:00:09.501
zoom through

00:00:09.655 --> 00:00:10.398
drawn like a

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:11.624
miniature model city

00:00:12.142 --> 00:00:13.226
Live Muni and

00:00:13.038 --> 00:00:13.981
BART vehicles

00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:15.420
ferries and planes

00:00:15.232 --> 00:00:16.163
move across it

00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:16.929
in real time

00:00:16.989 --> 00:00:18.580
with simulated traffic

00:00:18.463 --> 00:00:19.229
and the real

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:20.066
sky overhead

00:00:20.606 --> 00:00:21.679
It turns live

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:22.705
transit data into

00:00:22.516 --> 00:00:23.259
a tiny

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:24.450
living city you

00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:25.429
can explore right

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.231
from your browser

00:00:26.766 --> 00:00:27.780
Full story on

00:00:27.591 --> 00:00:28.487
the dashboard
